The main problems with this are the same as the problems with a legit
form of savescumming.  People wouldn't use it for protection from
"accidents", as much as they would id-ing items, testing enchant
limits, etc.
 
For example, you pick up an un-ided scroll, you rec it and it
teleports you, you think "okay, teleportation, this could come in
handy" and backspace and call it teleportation.
 
This isn't even helpful for newbies in the long run, because it just
gives them bad habits...

